#readmeHeader()

This example demonstrates how to implement and register a custom
DDS_ContentFilterI content filter with RTI Connext DDS Micro in a
CERT-compatible build.

Key features:
  - Custom filter implemented in the application module
    (${envMap.idlFileName}Application.h / ${envMap.idlFileName}Application.c)
  - DPSE static endpoint discovery
  - Writer-side filtering: publisher registers the custom filter and
    asserts the remote subscription with content filter info
  - Reader-side filtering: subscriber registers the custom filter
    and configures DataReader QoS

